{"title":"책만 보고 탑배우!","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=cDvLCy/hAd4pjWArO/Ac9vZkcD9khU37j65EuLkk&filename=th3","synopsis":"재능이 없어 연기를 포기하고 작가로 전향한 성현. \n\n성현은 시나리오에 천부적인 재능을 가진 천재 작가로 승승장구하지만, \n여전히 연기를 그리워하고 있다. \n\n그러던 어느 날, 촬영장에서 트럭 사고를 당하고\n“다시 태어나면 꼭 연기를 해야지.” 다짐하며 눈을 감는데…\n\n13년 전, 24살의 나이로 회귀한 성현. 그리고, 대본 속으로 들어가\n그 캐릭터 자체가 되는 메소드 능력까지!\n\n좋아, 이번 생은 천재 배우로 다시 태어나는 거야!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":204,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":215,"change":{"type":"down","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":205,"change":{"type":"up","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":156,"change":{"type":"up","amount":49}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":173,"change":{"type":"down","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":279,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":241,"change":{"type":"up","amount":38}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":182,"change":{"type":"up","amount":59}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":195,"change":{"type":"down","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":175,"change":{"type":"up","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":182,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":216,"change":{"type":"down","amount":34}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":243,"change":{"type":"down","amount":27}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":200,"change":{"type":"up","amount":43}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":203,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":186,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":180,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":211,"change":{"type":"down","amount":31}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":211,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":181,"change":{"type":"up","amount":30}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":159,"change":{"type":"up","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":167,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":18